#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GPM</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>GPM</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../gpm-&gpm-version;-consolidated-1.patch                &amp;&amp;\n"
"./autogen.sh                                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc ac_cv_path_emacs=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../gpm-&gpm-version;-consolidated-1.patch                &amp;&amp;\n"
"./autogen.sh                                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc ac_cv_path_emacs=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend='texlive'/> is installed, build the GPM manual as dvi, ps, "
"and pdf formats:"
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend='texlive'/> estiver instalado, construa o manual do GPM "
"como formatos dvi, ps e pdf:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:129
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make -C doc gpm.{dvi,ps} &amp;&amp;\n"
"dvipdfm doc/gpm.dvi -o doc/gpm.pdf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make -C doc gpm.{dvi,ps} &amp;&amp;\n"
"dvipdfm doc/gpm.dvi -o doc/gpm.pdf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:140
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install                                          &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install-info --dir-file=/usr/share/info/dir           \\\n"
"             /usr/share/info/gpm.info                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -fv /usr/lib/libgpm.a                              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv libgpm.so.2.1.0 /usr/lib/libgpm.so            &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 conf/gpm-root.conf /etc              &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-version;/support &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/support/*                     \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-version;/support &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/{FAQ,HACK_GPM,README*}        \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install                                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install-info --dir-file=/usr/share/info/dir           \\\n"
"             /usr/share/info/gpm.info                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -fv /usr/lib/libgpm.a                              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv libgpm.so.2.1.0 /usr/lib/libgpm.so            &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 conf/gpm-root.conf /etc              &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-version;/support &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/support/*                     \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-version;/support &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/{FAQ,HACK_GPM,README*}        \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend='texlive'/> is installed and you've built GPM manual as "
"dvi, ps, and pdf formats, install them as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend='texlive'/> estiver instalado e você tiver construído o "
"manual do GPM como formatos dvi, ps e pdf, instale-os como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:160
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vm644 doc/gpm.{dvi,ps,pdf} /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-"
"version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vm644 doc/gpm.{dvi,ps,pdf} /usr/share/doc/gpm-&gpm-"
"version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>./autogen.sh</command>: This command creates the missing "
"<command>configure</command> script."
msgstr ""
"<command>./autogen.sh</command>: Esse comando cria o ausente script "
"<command>configure</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>ac_cv_path_emacs=no</parameter>: This variable works around an "
"issue causing the package fail to build with <xref linkend='emacs'/> "
"installed.  It also suppresses the installations of some <quote>Emacs "
"support files</quote> shipped with GPM.  These files are quite outdated and "
"they should be superseded with <xref linkend='emacs'/> built-in GPM support."
"  If you need to use <xref linkend='emacs'/> in Linux console with mouse "
"support, you should install (or reinstall) <xref linkend='emacs'/> <emphasis"
" role='bold'>after</emphasis> GPM."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>ac_cv_path_emacs=no</parameter>: Essa variável soluciona um "
"problema que faz com que o pacote falhe para construir com <xref "
"linkend='emacs'/> instalado. Ela também suprime as instalações de alguns "
"<quote>arquivos de suporte do Emacs</quote> fornecidos com o GPM. Esses "
"arquivos estão bastante desatualizados e deveriam ser substituídos pelo "
"suporte GPM integrado ao <xref linkend='emacs'/>. Se precisar usar <xref "
"linkend='emacs'/> no console do Linux com suporte para mouse, você deveria "
"instalar (ou reinstalar) <xref linkend='emacs'/> <emphasis "
"role='bold'>depois</emphasis> do GPM."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:185
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install-info ...</command>: This package installs a <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.info</filename> file, but does not update the system "
"<filename>dir</filename> file. This command makes the update."
msgstr ""
"<command>install-info ...</command>: Esse pacote instala um arquivo "
"<filename class=\"extension\">.info</filename>, mas não atualiza o arquivo "
"<filename>dir</filename> do sistema. Esse comando faz a atualização."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>ln -v -sfn libgpm.so.2.1.0 /usr/lib/libgpm.so</command>: This "
"command is used to create (or update) the <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.so</filename> symlink to the library."
msgstr ""
"<command>ln -v -sfn libgpm.so.2.1.0 /usr/lib/libgpm.so</command>: Esse "
"comando é usado para criar (ou atualizar) o link simbólico <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.so</filename> para a biblioteca."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring GPM"
msgstr "Configurando o \"GPM\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Script de Inicialização</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/gpm</filename> init script included "
"in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package."
msgstr ""
"Instale o script de iniciação <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/gpm</filename> "
"incluído no pacote <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:216
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the <command>gpm</command> daemon at boot, install the systemd unit"
" from the <xref linkend=\"systemd-units\"/> package by running the following"
" command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o processo de segundo plano <command>gpm</command> na "
"inicialização, instale a unidade do \"systemd\" a partir do pacote <xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\"/> executando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:222
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-gpm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-gpm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/gpm-root.conf</filename> and <filename>~/.gpm-"
"root</filename>: The default and individual user <command>gpm-root</command>"
" configuration files."
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/gpm-root.conf</filename> e <filename>~/.gpm-root</filename>: "
"Os arquivos de configuração <command>gpm-root</command> padrão e de "
"usuário(a) individual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:236
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/mouse</filename>: This file contains the name of "
"your mouse device and the protocol it uses.  To create this file, run the "
"following as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/mouse</filename>: Esse arquivo contém o nome do seu"
" dispositivo de mouse e o protocolo que ele usa. Para criar esse arquivo, "
"execute o seguinte como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:242
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/mouse &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/sysconfig/mouse\n"
"\n"
"MDEVICE=\"<replaceable>&lt;yourdevice&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"PROTOCOL=\"<replaceable>&lt;yourprotocol&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"GPMOPTS=\"<replaceable>&lt;additional options&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/sysconfig/mouse</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sysconfig/mouse &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Começo /etc/sysconfig/mouse\n"
"\n"
"MDEVICE=\"<replaceable>&lt;seu_dispositivo&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"PROTOCOL=\"<replaceable>&lt;seu_protocolo&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"GPMOPTS=\"<replaceable>&lt;opções adicionais&gt;</replaceable>\"\n"
"\n"
"# Fim /etc/sysconfig/mouse</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.gpm-root"
msgstr "~/.gpm-root"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:257
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/gpm-root.conf"
msgstr "/etc/gpm-root.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:261
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/sysconfig/mouse"
msgstr "/etc/sysconfig/mouse"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:267
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:270
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Examples of values to set <envar>MDEVICE</envar>, <envar>PROTOCOL</envar>, "
"and <envar>GPMOPTS</envar> to are:"
msgstr ""
"Exemplos de valores para configurar <envar>MDEVICE</envar>, "
"<envar>PROTOCOL</envar> e <envar>GPMOPTS</envar> são:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:274
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>MDEVICE=\"/dev/input/mice\"\n"
"PROTOCOL=\"imps2\"\n"
"GPMOPTS=\"\"</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>MDEVICE=\"/dev/input/mice\"\n"
"PROTOCOL=\"imps2\"\n"
"GPMOPTS=\"\"</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A list of which protocol values are known can be found by running "
"<command>gpm -m <replaceable>[device]</replaceable> -t -help</command>.  The"
" <envar>MDEVICE</envar> setting depends on which type of mouse you have.  "
"For example, <filename>/dev/ttyS0</filename> for a serial mouse (on Windows "
"this is COM1), <filename>/dev/input/mice</filename> is often used for USB "
"mice and <filename>/dev/psaux</filename> for PS2 mice. "
"<envar>GPMOPTS</envar> is the 'catch all' for any additional options that "
"are needed for your hardware."
msgstr ""
"Uma lista de quais valores de protocolo são conhecidos pode ser encontrada "
"executando <command>gpm -m <replaceable>[dispositivo]</replaceable> -t "
"-help</command>. A configuração <envar>MDEVICE</envar> depende de qual tipo "
"de mouse você tiver. Por exemplo, <filename>/dev/ttyS0</filename> para um "
"mouse serial (no \"Windows\" isso é COM1), "
"<filename>/dev/input/mice</filename> é frequentemente usado para mouses USB "
"e <filename>/dev/psaux</filename> para mouses PS2. <envar>GPMOPTS</envar> é "
"o 'pega tudo' para quaisquer opções adicionais que sejam necessárias para o "
"seu hardware."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/gpm.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>GPM</application> is by default started with the following "
"parameters: <parameter>-m /dev/input/mice -t imps2</parameter>. If the "
"mentioned parameters don't suit your needs, you can override them by running"
" the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"<application>GPM</application> é iniciado por padrão com os seguintes "
"parâmetros: <parameter>-m /dev/input/mice -t imps2</parameter>. Se os "
"parâmetros mencionados não atenderem às suas necessidades, [então] você pode"
" substituí-los executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) "
